      "claim": "The project performance-policy parser incorrectly accepts case-variant mode values such as `ENABLED`, allowing malformed policy input to activate the performance stage instead of being rejected.",
      "basis": "The parser lowercases the supplied Mode value before validation, although the governed contract requires Mode to be exactly `disabled` or `enabled` and strict boundary validation to reject malformed input [qa-v1-block-c60e8152c304432fc78d7a0c, qa-v1-block-ce45392d2ebc036986b89d13, qa-v1-block-27d2771fd1e216ea720fc578].",
